1
00:00:00,827 --> 00:00:03,867
(Leonard:)Sheldon, there's something
I wanna talk to you about before we go.

2
00:00:04,038 --> 00:00:08,088
(Sheldon:)I don't care if anybody gets it,
I'm going as the Doppler effect.

3
00:00:08,543 --> 00:00:13,003
- No, it's not that...
- If I have to, I can demonstrate: Vroom.

4
00:00:15,883 --> 00:00:18,223
(Leonard:)Terrific. Um...

5
00:00:18,803 --> 00:00:21,263
(Leonard:)This party is my first chance for Penny...

6
00:00:21,431 --> 00:00:24,521
(Leonard:)...to see me in the context
of her social group...

7
00:00:24,684 --> 00:00:27,354
(Leonard:)...and I need you not
to embarrass me tonight.

8
00:00:28,521 --> 00:00:30,521
(Sheldon:)What exactly do you mean
by embarrass you?

9
00:00:31,399 --> 00:00:36,699
For example, tonight, no one needs to know
that my middle name is Leakey.

10
00:00:36,863 --> 00:00:38,863
But there's nothing embarrassing
about that.

11
00:00:39,032 --> 00:00:42,242
Your father worked with Louis Leakey,
a great anthropologist.

12
00:00:42,410 --> 00:00:44,950
(Sheldon:)It had nothing to do
with your bed-wetting.

13
00:00:46,497 --> 00:00:49,417
(Leonard:)All I'm saying is that this party
is the perfect opportunity...

14
00:00:49,584 --> 00:00:52,624
(Leonard:)...for Penny to see me
as a member of her peer group...

15
00:00:52,795 --> 00:00:57,025
(Leonard:)...a potential close friend
and perhaps more.

